docs {
  # Patient Categories

  Registration › Patient Settings › Patient Category — patient pricing tiers
  (e.g. "General", "VIP", "Senior Citizen"), each mapped to a Lab Test List /
  Lab Panel List. Tenant-scoped, tenant-level (name/status/default are shared
  across the tenant's branches); the Lab Test List / Lab Panel List selections
  are scoped to the caller's active branch (from the JWT profile — requires a
  business token with an active branch set), since they reference branch-level
  `BranchLabTest`/`BranchLabPanel` rows.

  - **"General"** is bootstrapped automatically (active + default) the first
    time `GET /patient-categories` is called for a tenant — there is no
    separate seed/setup request.
  - Only one category can be the tenant's default at a time — setting a new
    default automatically clears the previous one.
  - Categories cannot be deleted (no DELETE route) — only deactivated — to
    preserve historical order pricing. The default category cannot be
    deactivated; an inactive category cannot be made default.

  All routes are business-authenticated (`Bearer {{businessAccessToken}}`);
  tenant comes from the JWT, active branch from the JWT profile. Writes are
  audited under `AuditModule.PATIENT_CATEGORY`.
}
